                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.51/876: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Representative on Special Mission in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Crowder</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-10-28T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 28,
                                1922—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>73. Your telegram No. 72, October 24, 6 p.m.</p>
                <p>Governor Harding has arranged to leave Washington November 1, arriving Habana
                    November 3, 5 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
